      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm prepping for a meeting with some local reps about these new carbon emission standards coming down the pipe. My manufacturing plant is going to take a massive hit on compliance costs. Can you put together a solid list of arguments I can use to show why these new standards are problematic for mid-sized businesses like mine? I need some heavy-hitting points on the economic impact.",
